{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_e6666ce6e88b49c0a602625705d991f9","id":"pg_93525acfcaf759c4b0603083a70dc8ac","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/autohandai-code-cli-docs-autohand-in-chrome-md-f4775fdebd93-3083a70dc8ac.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6f5d5a9643df51eca4f38c21afdb033d"],"title":"autohandai/code-cli/docs/autohand-in-chrome.md @ f4775fdebd93","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e6666ce6e88b49c0a602625705d991f9"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_04c47572c18fd0d86abcaa123f311b92e1c62c0ec1997f9dd8c144a8fff1abb0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills are discovered from many locations with later sources taking precedence, including built-in dist skills, Codex, Claude, shared agent directories, Autohand user/project dirs, and extension contributions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0fe27beccf53825a779c8fe54ab85a48e0fbe14a5beab2eae40fbce7e008d9a9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills are SKILL.md packages with YAML frontmatter (name, description, optional allowed-tools, license, compatibility, metadata) plus markdown instructions injected into agent context when activated."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6026759256d34afe67334115c65547ad00ed4365841d993485992fde236b68f4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Delegated workers read up to five recent project lessons (each truncated to 1,000 chars) from the workspace's .autohand/memory; bare mode disables this, and agent.autoMemory:false disables automatic lesson saving."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6d7ed083768bb9f67c429da0c57011804668192a6954874c040aa51f48683123"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills declare a space-delimited allowed-tools list restricting which tools they may use, and the agent prompts before risky operations unless a different permission mode is chosen."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7976533c20c6ab2bd70007c6148e0b32abdf754f3fd6c0a5b900f6f324b33559"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Memory tools include save_memory, recall_memory (ranked by content, tags, recency), inspect_memory, and delete_memory which retains a canonical deletion event."},{"claim_ids":["clm_96322a6ba78b65463d9e38171f3bf42b9501c816ac86f0a30e983412f045db00"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills found in Codex or Claude locations are auto-copied to the corresponding Autohand locations, and existing Autohand skills are never overwritten."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c7d75e94edbeda87c007a68415cb256ae8d1493b7c07015a787e9a062e517227"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Slash commands include /skills (list, use, deactivate, info, new) and /deep-research with a /deep-search alias for research runs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d8fd1ecb52e61e022bfee0494a507fe87a913345c2cd9848b872ae7f44b1a96f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The bundled deep-research skill runs multi-task research with persisted status (task progress, tool, evidence/failure counts, tokens), and a run is marked complete only after tasks finish, the report passes a source audit, and project checks pass."}],"claim_ids":["clm_04c47572c18fd0d86abcaa123f311b92e1c62c0ec1997f9dd8c144a8fff1abb0","clm_0fe27beccf53825a779c8fe54ab85a48e0fbe14a5beab2eae40fbce7e008d9a9","clm_6026759256d34afe67334115c65547ad00ed4365841d993485992fde236b68f4","clm_6d7ed083768bb9f67c429da0c57011804668192a6954874c040aa51f48683123","clm_7976533c20c6ab2bd70007c6148e0b32abdf754f3fd6c0a5b900f6f324b33559","clm_96322a6ba78b65463d9e38171f3bf42b9501c816ac86f0a30e983412f045db00","clm_c7d75e94edbeda87c007a68415cb256ae8d1493b7c07015a787e9a062e517227","clm_d8fd1ecb52e61e022bfee0494a507fe87a913345c2cd9848b872ae7f44b1a96f"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_e6666ce6e88b49c0a602625705d991f9","id":"pg_a41082accdd55c8da57e090302e1ddb5","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/autohandai-code-cli-docs-agent-skills-md-f4775fdebd93-090302e1ddb5.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_84e7823f7b4e56148c658cb71b054c55"],"title":"autohandai/code-cli/docs/agent-skills.md @ f4775fdebd93","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e6666ce6e88b49c0a602625705d991f9"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1773e6c7cba31627581866f68555329783eeded32baf77f8ec715f0c2d6b353a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Every installer scans writable PATH directories and silently replaces any existing `agent` command so `agent` resolves to Autohand, which can break other tools' `agent` commands."},{"claim_ids":["clm_17d5f5fbbf5a76998b7885f28c2127c135da79dc9550891055d7fff88ce8f2ea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI is exposed as `autohand`, `autohand-code`, and `agent`, with `autohand` as the canonical name."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5b2b35906618dad123d4e97d2ea9a54b4b77757a9fb0ae984c4d2cfeb82ded6c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product runs as a terminal REPL with file mentions, slash commands, keyboard shortcuts, provider switching, and session history available from one prompt."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6d7ed083768bb9f67c429da0c57011804668192a6954874c040aa51f48683123"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills declare a space-delimited allowed-tools list restricting which tools they may use, and the agent prompts before risky operations unless a different permission mode is chosen."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8d3b97bc088f8bc8dad41fe45c88178a80412c6a417098be9c6be33a3969a323"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent supports multiple LLM providers including OpenRouter, OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, DeepSeek, Azure, Z.ai, Vertex AI, Ollama, llama.cpp, MLX, and local models."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1773e6c7cba31627581866f68555329783eeded32baf77f8ec715f0c2d6b353a","clm_17d5f5fbbf5a76998b7885f28c2127c135da79dc9550891055d7fff88ce8f2ea","clm_5b2b35906618dad123d4e97d2ea9a54b4b77757a9fb0ae984c4d2cfeb82ded6c","clm_6d7ed083768bb9f67c429da0c57011804668192a6954874c040aa51f48683123","clm_8d3b97bc088f8bc8dad41fe45c88178a80412c6a417098be9c6be33a3969a323"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_e6666ce6e88b49c0a602625705d991f9","id":"pg_ed8bd4bf30615a86b05e36959a944e61","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/autohandai-code-cli-readme-md-f4775fdebd93-36959a944e61.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_e9b8acb4fb3a5eebaed52cbc1a9cf04a"],"title":"autohandai/code-cli/README.md @ f4775fdebd93","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e6666ce6e88b49c0a602625705d991f9"}
